  m_text: "<color=#00FFDB>A / D</color> ho\u1EB7c ph\xEDm m\u0169i t\xEAn: Di chuy\u1EC3n\n<color=#00FFDB>Space</color>:
    Nh\u1EA3y (gi\u1EEF l\xE2u \u0111\u1EC3 nh\u1EA3y cao h\u01A1n)\nCh\u1EA1m t\u01B0\u1EDDng
    khi \u0111ang nh\u1EA3y + <color=#00FFDB>Space</color>: B\u1EADt t\u01B0\u1EDDng\n<color=#00FFDB>U</color>:
    \u0110\xE1nh (b\u1EA5m li\xEAn t\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EC3 ra \u0111\xF2n li\xEAn ho\xE0n)\nTr\xEAn kh\xF4ng giữ <color=#00FFDB>S</color> + <color=#00FFDB>U</color>: Dậm xuống\n<color=#00FFDB>I</color>:
    \u0110\xF2n m\u1EA1nh (m\u1EDF kh\xF3a sau M\xE0n 1, h\u1ED3i chi\xEAu 7 gi\xE2y)\n<color=#00FFDB>R</color>:
    B\u1EAFn t\u01A1 - tr\xFAng 2 ph\xE1t li\u1EC1n s\u1EBD tr\xF3i \u0111\u1ECBch\n<color=#00FFDB>Q</color>:
    T\u01A1 k\xE9o - bay t\u1EDBi t\u01B0\u1EDDng ho\u1EB7c k\xE9o \u0111\u1ECBch
    b\u1ECB tr\xF3i\n<color=#00FFDB>Left Shift</color>: N\xE9 (ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    tr\xEAn m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA5t)\n<color=#00FFDB>Esc</color>: T\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng
    (trong m\xE0n ch\u01A1i)\nT\u01A1 c\xF3 6 vi\xEAn, nh\u1EB7t v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m
    t\u01A1 \u0111\u1EC3 n\u1EA1p l\u1EA1i."
